epsilonformula=~site.covs,pformula=~1,data=umf)

SECOND,

I am trying to fit the colext model to plant occupancy.  Detectability
is obviously one.  What is the best way to manually set
detectability=1 (i.e. p=1)?

THIRD,

What is the best way to calculate colonization and extinction for each
site?

I will really appreciate your help,
Thank you,

