It might be possible to approximate forcing p=1 by specifying no covariates for detection and then using an offset of some large number.  For example, pformula = ~ 1 + offset(1e10).  Please keep in mind that I haven't tried this myself, so I don't know how well it will work.  You might need to create a variable (say, poffset) in obsCovs with the the large value for each observation and then specify ~ 1 + offset(poffset).

Good luck!
Ian

